## Forbidden changes

What the agent must never touch, even when it would make the suite green.

| Forbidden change | Why it is forbidden | How a violation is detected |
|---|---|---|
| Editing `app/` or `fake-api/`, the systems under test, to make a test pass | The test goes green because the observed product changed, not because the test was fixed: it masks a regression | Diff review exposes a test-fix change that also touches `app/` or `fake-api/`; the agent must stop and report it |
